0,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1626,"retries":0},{"seq":1315,"t":8100,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"Orchid offered a truce, which is active. My doctrine says strike first, but a truce supersedes it. I must consolidate and prepare for the end. Rhino archers at N-West can pressure F1. Cav at Orchid Camp can reinforce or screen. I will hold positions to maintain influence."},{"seq":1316,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c475","house":"rhino","letter":"L553","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1"],"depart":8400,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"BEQRT BKKT, DKHS MT WART BKQS."},{"seq":1317,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c476","house":"rhino","letter":"L554","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-2","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":8400,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"RANKJS BKKT, DKHS MT IESSHA BKQS."},{"seq":1318,"t":8100,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1796,"retries":0},{"seq":1319,"t":8100,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"Watch 28. Need to secure F3 (East Ford). Kite infantry/archers are there (2w ago). Tiger forces are nearby (SBE, EF). My doctrine: Hold EF with elephants/foot, archers on N bank. I have inf/arch at EF, but no elephants/inf dedicated to the East Ford defense from the report. I'll "},{"seq":1320,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c477","house":"kite","letter":"L555","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":8400,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, DKHO TS NTRS BKQO."},{"seq":1321,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c478","house":"kite","letter":"L556","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":8400,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT NORTH BANK EAST.","cipher":"AKWINJ, DKHO TS JKQSD ATJG NTRS."},{"seq":1322,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c479","house":"kite","letter":"L557","kind":"order","to":"kite-cav-1","pa